{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "428b04722f04bb59026ac7f7cb6a4d1e6e1e891b579d79de6a1bd61750d03201", "ja": "甘くナツメグ？　ぎゅっとハグ！", "zh": "甜甜肉豆蔻？紧紧抱住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4cddd76414711aeec25049f978481c94f848401f6f36dd71bf44cefe48d25665", "ja": "公演も大成功し、ゲーミングカレーも話題に\nなっている。打ち上げに、莉緒と可奈が行っ\nたオトナなお店にやってきたメンバー達。そ\nれぞれの個性のきらめきを見て、今後の活躍\nに期待するプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "公演大获成功，游戏咖喱也成了热门话题。  \n为了参加庆功宴，成员们来到了莉绪和可奈去过的那家成熟风格的店。  \n制作人看着大家各自闪耀的个性，对她们今后的表现充满期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3ea3eee4bf46d703e83a2287944ce92312449eee77d80063f125853d6382e5d4", "ja": "（公演は大盛況で終わった。新曲の披露も、\nすごく盛り上がって、熱いステージだったな！）", "zh": "（公演在一片盛况中落下帷幕。新曲的首次演出也非常热烈，真是一场气氛火热的舞台啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8575dde09231b3db75b71d0b7ff315cb26e2e23507af746325dd70395aee7271", "ja": "（そして……とうとうゲーミングカレーも発売開始！\nSNSでも話題になり、売り切れのお店もあるとか）", "zh": "（然后……游戏咖喱终于也开始发售了！\n听说在社交平台上也成了热门话题，还有店铺已经卖光了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "f476678128a4de14db47914c33cb6168a09c0989ec8fb836ed9ddd230ca1c135", "ja": "ふわぁ……すごく、オシャレ……♪\nこういうお店、入らないから……杏奈、ドキドキ……。", "zh": "呼哇……好时髦……♪\n因为平时不会进这种店……杏奈，有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "241e736fc1430042b3feeab169e8f19847b8b68b1724f812284a0b09d6396e76", "ja": "打ち上げ、またこのお店でよかったんだよな？\n可奈がすごく推してきたけど。", "zh": "庆功宴又选这家店，没问题吧？\n可奈可是极力推荐来这里的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "c81262d736f797b7756ed74c44fd5c9c1c7900179ccac03aa69b68af3bcf19f9", "ja": "はい！　このお店でもう一度、\nみんなとカレーが食べたいなって！", "zh": "是的！我想再和大家一起，\n在这家店吃咖喱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "86b9aabcdffc004e3c49334c8bddebaa2ec1a54ed519a0a6d77bd89ef28ddba3", "ja": "可奈ちゃんと杏奈ちゃんと一緒に決めたの♪\nねー？", "zh": "这是我和可奈、小杏一起决定的♪\n对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "999a2657a59df10d35eceb33f4a26de3755a7869a7c4123daccb4af2f0d4bf63", "ja": "うん……♪　杏奈も、うれしい……。\nふたりから話聞いて、来てみたかったから……。", "zh": "嗯……♪　杏奈也很开心……\n听她们两个说了以后，就一直想来看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1c830f9dc55dea68ad81edafe24228e72c586ed00eb285bd38f407657593ee54", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nよし、今日は好きなメニューを頼んでくれ！", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n好，今天想吃什么就尽管点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "17737ff666e22c32544352203894f735e6aa075dca9137d942be9ae46cd6f3e2", "ja": "おいしい……！\nこんな、カレーの料理……はじめて、かも……。", "zh": "好吃……！\n这种咖喱料理……可能还是第一次吃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "de8ba6afc611cc9e7fc111de1bad53db02a8054377e6dd6b8792e408f25c09fa", "ja": "でしょ～♪　あっ！　長芋の炒め物もオススメだよ！\n私もこの前初めて食べたけど、おいしいよ！", "zh": "对吧～♪啊！炒山药也很推荐哦！\n我也是前不久第一次吃，不过真的很好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "9f5cefb656527fc4a386795e4c8f560fd0ffec2e4495112d654eda499cef154e", "ja": "そうそう。杏奈ちゃんも、ぜひ食べてみて♪\nスパイスが絶妙で、どんなお酒にも合うの。", "zh": "对对。杏奈也一定要尝尝看哦♪\n香料搭配得恰到好处，配什么酒都很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "f5baeac3ba970b628564cc7b61198e0717208a959e2d2a904eaf162212c16dc7", "ja": "お酒との、相性……。\nカレーは、奥が深い、ね……。", "zh": "和酒的相性……  \n咖喱真是博大精深……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "f611866ae72e93357e6ad37d4858423d750339c8e0f7bcec70312c064a8751dc", "ja": "私は甘口がいいな～。辛すぎるのはやっぱりね……\nううっ、まだまだ大人にはなれないかも……。", "zh": "我想要甜口的～太辣了果然还是……呜呜，我可能还没办法成为大人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "3f4088e036db095c2c7d93f1bb63150b88739888a960455d88683aa30b24da1e", "ja": "そんなことないわよ！　だって、ふたりとも、\n恋の歌を、上手に歌いこなしてたじゃない？", "zh": "才不是那样！因为你们两个人，不是都把恋爱歌曲唱得很棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "b1cfe89b86920a99108bd23099a9b1123c4008fcd8b17b64b3f863c011b9c007", "ja": "恋の、歌……？", "zh": "恋爱、歌曲……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "8cea42844eb37476e894e6ffd67ee6a1e912854370993b46b4562c1218a9cbe6", "ja": "恋の歌……？", "zh": "恋爱的歌……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5eb82eb4c822cba01d261256b908f96814b28ae57155587e92cc591a5410c6bc", "ja": "え？　新曲のことだよな。好きな人への気持ちを、\nカレーへの情熱にたとえた歌だからな。", "zh": "诶？说的是新歌吧。那可是把对喜欢之人的感情，比作对咖喱的热情所写的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "75455a0cd3d716438c4f73465a74a0088f58e1482079d51052856cddb3bc2c67", "ja": "ええっ、そうなんですか！？\n私、カレーが大好き～っていう歌だと思ってました！", "zh": "诶？原来是这样吗！？\n我还以为是首“我最喜欢咖喱啦～”的歌呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "801b359ee3285c53ec347ee799523d8c600580da9b765fb62202d3874239dcca", "ja": "カレーの情熱……好きな人の、愛情……。\nそう、なの……？", "zh": "咖喱的热情……还有对喜欢之人的爱意……  \n原来，是这样的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "cd93422b223335c1d845b6fe4f67ab0febd8bdecc64357ee60c9048906f40d64", "ja": "歌詞を見ると、恋に振り回されてる感じがしない？\nそれに、「カレー」と「彼」がかかってたりとか……。", "zh": "看歌词的话，不觉得有种被恋爱牵着鼻子走的感觉吗？\n而且，“咖喱”和“他”还同音双关什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "98bdb24ddf0282ae54d832c6f4a828ea5296b16cad962c581a1e63639ab3df2e", "ja": "……！　杏奈……全然、気付かなかった……。", "zh": "……！　杏奈……完全，没注意到……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "7842ccd934dc06fda438f7205e10c37c48ef874670c91b47bad01796407e1696", "ja": "はわ～……私も知らなかった……。\nさ、さすが！　大人です、莉緒さん！", "zh": "哇～……我也不知道……  \n不、不愧是你！莉绪姐真是大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "b839050448b02ab859485efc48a469ff39adf6fae2c4984716bbf76ba9216162", "ja": "うん……。それに莉緒さん……いい匂い、する……\nぎゅって、してもらうと……気持ちいいし……♪", "zh": "嗯……而且，莉绪姐……身上好香……\n\n被她紧紧抱住的话……感觉也很舒服……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "b1573dd63ed670b8228dc9b4728f0b45b21dc20cfb9db3126d988c4c71c35e04", "ja": "わかるわかる。\n莉緒さんの～♪　トリコになっちゃう、私たち～♪", "zh": "懂的懂的。\n莉绪小姐的～♪　俘虏就是我们俩～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "02c33d0eb0eef0241d68b088eb010791bbb627be0130756fd36d9143f8b0874b", "ja": "ははっ。莉緒がトリコにしたのは、\nファンだけじゃなくて、可奈と杏奈もだったな。", "zh": "哈哈。被莉绪迷住的，不只是粉丝，还有可奈和杏奈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "72345e1e63a77a066954084bc79a0d56f7964c780d82424d28f59b525ccb3dca", "ja": "あ、あら？　こんなはずじゃなかったんだけど……\nでもま、たまにはこういうのもいっか♪", "zh": "啊、哎呀？本来不该是这样的……\n不过嘛，偶尔这样也不错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "dbd9cb091e0a4fa67d24ef11f2e81a25b3372699902b3fb3e4afd19ff7431a0f", "ja": "よ～し、ふたりとも！\nお姉さんでよければ、いつでもハグしてあげるわよ～♪", "zh": "好～了，你们两个！\n要是不嫌弃姐姐的话，姐姐随时都可以抱抱你们哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "134bac8c05ee350eea3647c06a7cce2ebb46bcdc5932c134de88ac3efd29abf2", "ja": "やった……♪", "zh": "太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b7060cdf077616b32082b042ef971cbc690e4c5ca264b9bb784f4dc85d4cdbf", "ja": "やった～！", "zh": "太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "1ee789be03ce27da1d4da494fd67699a3e7aab2be3e3860d0635a17d7809a3eb", "ja": "（個性が重なり合って、いろんな味になる……。\nそれは、料理もユニットも同じかもしれない）", "zh": "（个性彼此交融，就会呈现出各种各样的风味……。料理和组合或许也是一样的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "682440ebb2d2eb6de807e0c03ba4f7f93eb8d816b715bfd92101b99d0f01b978", "ja": "（このユニットが、どんな味わいを見せるのか……。\n次の食卓も楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（真期待这个组合会展现出怎样的风味……\n下一顿饭也值得期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
